     * {@link #addEdges} calls and finish with {@link #build()}:
     *
     * <pre>{@code
     *   DirectedGraph g = DirectedGraph.builder(4)
     *       .addEdge(0, 1)
     *       .addEdge(1, 2)
     *       .addEdge(2, 0)
     *       .build();
